#. Source-owned DUNGEON.DAT DB2 text
msgid ""
"THERE IS ONLY ONE\n"
"LEVEL HERE.      \n"
"                 \n"
"FIRST CHOOSE YOUR\n"
"CHAMPIONS...THEN\n"
"SAVE THE GAME...\n"
"THEN RESTART WITH\n"
"THE UTILITY DISK."
msgstr ""
"하나만 있어요\n"
"레벨은 여기입니다.      \n"
"                 \n"
"먼저 선택하세요\n"
"챔피언...그럼\n"
"게임을 저장하세요...\n"
"그런 다음 다시 시작하십시오.\n"
"유틸리티 디스크."

